  (text "BAT54S: pin 1 anode = GND; pin 2 cathode = +5V; pin 3 midpoint = MCU data.\nHigh data clamps toward +5V; negative data clamps toward GND. No target HV on these paths.\n1k limits MCU/buffer contention. HCT245 and target-side protection are on the TTL bus sheet." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 20 168 0) (effects (font (size 1.2 1.2)) (justify left)) (uuid "3553792b-53d7-550e-905c-a16d1a813627"))
  (text "Data protection and status LEDs" (exclude_from_sim no) (at 15 15 0) (effects (font (size 2.5 2.5)) (justify left)) (uuid "80c4d609-133b-5686-b310-8d73ca9a4f23"))
  (text "RGB cathode LOW = ON. Green: READ; Red: WRITE; Amber: IDLE; Blue: ERROR.\nRX/TX PNP emitters = +5V; base current is limited by 10k. UART HIGH idle = LEDs OFF.\nD2: combined SMD 5050 / THT5 footprint. Populate ONE ONLY; pads 1R/2A/3G/4B." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 20 280 0) (effects (font (size 1.05 1.05)) (justify left)) (uuid "89b0d255-b93e-5997-b22a-d4acee57e5f7"))
